# CREDITS — First Orange

A ~42-second film in the Impasto Oil Painting style, made entirely in code.
The kitchen, orange and story are invented: no real brand or place is portrayed.

## Voice
Speech synthesis: Kokoro (kokoro-onnx), voice `af_heart`, English. Model and engine
are released under the licences of the kokoro-onnx project
(https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx). Offline synthesis.

## Music
Original score, synthesised and sampled for this film (`music/score.py`).
Acoustic guitar plucks are physically modelled (`core/audio/pluck.py`).

Samples (CC0 1.0): VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios /
Sam Gossner), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios).

## Typefaces
- Cormorant Garamond — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Catharsis Fonts); see `fonts/OFL.txt`

## Picture
Every frame is drawn with the film's own knife-stroke engine (`engine/impasto.js`).
No stock footage, no photographs, no third-party images.

## Sound effects
All foley is synthesised for this film (`mix.py`): room hush, birds, knife scrapes,
wet peels, juice drips.
